.DS_Store
dist/
vz-runner/.build/
*.dmg
go.work
go.work.sum
.worktrees/

# Staging for release artifacts built outside dist/ (see release.yml).
/build/

# The binary a plain `go build` drops in the repo root. It was committed once
# by accident and shipped in a tag; nothing in the release path consumes it,
# which is exactly why nobody would notice it changing.
/hull
/vz-runner
/hvi
# ...but /vz-runner is also the name of the Swift package DIRECTORY, and the
# rule above matches both. Un-ignore the directory, or every new source file
# under it is silently untracked -- already-tracked ones keep working, which is
# exactly what makes it easy to miss.
!/vz-runner/
